{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udce6 Courier Life Simulator - Alpha</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Delivery Empire \u2014 One Package at a Time</strong>Ever wondered what it\u2019s really like to live the life of a courier?<br>In <strong>Courier Life Simulator</strong>, you don\u2019t just deliver packages \u2014 <strong>you live the job</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start as a small-time delivery worker, clock in for your shift, load your vehicle, fight traffic, manage time, earn money,, and grow into a true delivery professional. Every decision matters, every delivery counts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude9a Start Your Shift. Do the Job. Get Paid.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/extras/81880327a65e28cc9beeefbab8d83e8f.poster.avif?t=1768925467\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/extras/81880327a65e28cc9beeefbab8d83e8f.webm?t=1768925467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/extras/81880327a65e28cc9beeefbab8d83e8f.mp4?t=1768925467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Clock in and prepare for your daily route<br>\u2714 Accept delivery jobs with different challenges<br>\u2714 Manage your time, fuel, and efficiency<br>\u2714 Experience the routine \u2014 and pressure \u2014 of real courier work</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is <strong>hands-on, immersive simulation</strong>, where you feel like you\u2019re actually on the job.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udce6 Load, Drive &amp; Deliver \u2014 Realistic Delivery Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/extras/81733f6022b63643909f60741d00330b.poster.avif?t=1768925467\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/extras/81733f6022b63643909f60741d00330b.webm?t=1768925467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/extras/81733f6022b63643909f60741d00330b.mp4?t=1768925467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude97 Buy Personal Cars &amp; Drive Freely</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/extras/8b1f11e7625d7c7006fa89c4674a72a9.poster.avif?t=1768925467\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/extras/8b1f11e7625d7c7006fa89c4674a72a9.webm?t=1768925467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/extras/8b1f11e7625d7c7006fa89c4674a72a9.mp4?t=1768925467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Buy <strong>personal cars</strong> \u2014 not a company fleet<br>\u2714 Drive anytime, even outside of work<br>\u2714 Enjoy realistic handling and car physics<br>\u2714 Explore the city freely with no objectives<br><br>Courier Life Simulator isn\u2019t just about working \u2014<br>it\u2019s about <strong>enjoying the drive</strong>.<br><br>\ud83d\udcb8 Earn, Buy, Enjoy \u2014 Natural Progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Earn money through deliveries<br>\u2714 Buy better personal cars<br>\u2714 Improve your driving experience<br>\u2714 Balance work and freedom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work hard when you want.<br>Drive freely when you don\u2019t.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Made for Simulation Fans</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Courier &amp; delivery simulators</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life simulation games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person driving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free-roam car games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing progression</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Courier Life Simulator</strong> is built for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><br>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic courier job simulation focused on routine, responsibility, and freedom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open delivery system \u2014 choose what, when, and where to deliver.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living world with economic opportunities outside your shift.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of job realism and lifestyle freedom, allowing you to create your own path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Currently in Alpha:</strong> features, systems, and world content are being actively developed and expanded based on player feedback.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806380?t=1768925467","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806380?t=1768925467","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/adeb9c16b3d735e9ecb671cff55720413720d98d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768925467","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806380/adeb9c16b3d735e9ecb671cff55720413720d98d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768925467","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3971380,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 